# Plan: Add GCP Support — Phases 1–3 (Backend, Backwards-Compatible)

## Goal

Add GCP as a third cloud platform across the ctl-api data models, API endpoints, workflow logic, and runner auth/registry packages. All changes are additive — existing AWS and Azure code paths are untouched. The dashboard (Phase 4), SDK codegen (Phase 5), and testing (Phase 6) follow separately.

---

## Phase 1: Core Data Models & Types

All changes are additive new constants, new structs, and new pointer fields on existing structs. No existing fields are modified or removed.

