Add pointer to `InstallStackOutputs`:
```go
GCPStackOutputs   *GCPStackOutputs   `json:"gcp,omitzero" gorm:"-" temporaljson:"gcp_stack_outputs,omitzero,omitempty"`
```

Update `AfterQuery` — the current code checks `_, isAzure := a.Data["resource_group_id"]` to distinguish Azure from AWS. Add a GCP check before the Azure check:
```go
_, isGCP := a.Data["project_id"]
if isGCP {
    // decode into GCPStackOutputs using mapstructure (same pattern as Azure)
} else if isAzure {
    // existing Azure decode
} else {
    // existing AWS decode
}
```

**Important:** The `project_id` key is unique to GCP outputs (AWS uses `account_id`, Azure uses `resource_group_id`), so this detection remains unambiguous.

